  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这是你今天第三次睡醒，早安老陈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我昏迷了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "十几秒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——星熊，让开。我来切碎积石。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不好意思，我不能让。让这么一下，你我可能就都没了。我不要紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你的胳膊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "不要紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "......你撑不了多久！至少有两层楼的废墟压在你的盾上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我不用撑多久。现在你醒了就好办了，蹲下，你要随时准备好冲出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "无论有多重——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "——只要能被我掀开——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "——就也没多重！！啊啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哈，哈......哎，推这么一下，这只胳膊居然就真不行了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你又救了我一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "很奇怪吗，我救你的次数还少吗？就别郑重其事地说出来了，我听着不舒服。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "让我歇一会，我觉得全身骨头都散架了......偶尔也得允许我动弹不得一回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......该死，这都没能干掉近卫局吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "但敌人不允许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "这就没办法了。看来还是得勉强站起来动一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你快去整顿队伍，速度。别被这些人拖住脚步，他们就是干这个的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我觉得先处理掉他们也不迟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你就不能先去看还有什么人受伤了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "然后留你一身伤，独自面对整合运动？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "老陈。你以为你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "两年前在下水，你自己去追的匪首。我腿脚受了伤，但你很信任我，你留下我一个人战斗。你还记得吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那次我追了他多长时间？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "三个小时。你可以信任我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "现在也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你们，整合运动！一齐上吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "text": "可恶，居然挑衅我们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我还能战斗。为什么这次你要留在这里，为什么不去率队夺回近卫局？这难道不才是首要任务吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "现在和三年前没有区别，你依然扛着只有你才能做的事情！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "刚才在木禾仓库也是，你什么时候变得那么婆妈？老陈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我不觉得保护自己的同事不受暴徒侵害有什么问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你变了。以前的你是更刚强的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "把你丢在这里？当然可以。只不过我以前权衡的是利弊，但现在，就像你说的那样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "把阿米娅他们留在废城这件事，我也一样感到......不适。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1011_wizard",
      "text": "你们会尝到感染者的愤怒的！上啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "也许我确实变了。时间久了，我对龙门的不满越来越少，相信我的人也越来越多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你也不再仅仅是星熊督察了，你是我的朋友，我的搭档，星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你的盾，你替我撑了这么久；偶尔也要允许我做一回你的盾牌，星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哗。你说这话脸都不红一下的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "*龙门粗口*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "算了，行吧。行啊，老陈，都听你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
